es ranging from 283 to 715. After carefully reviewing the monthly figures, I confirm the median falls precisely between 498 and 504, resulting in a median of 501 million dollars.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_8071d2708638b6d0","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":{"content":"- [x] Explore available resources (JSON and text files)\n- [x] Extract Treasury Operating Balance data for Jan-Dec 1957\n- [x] Calculate median value\n- [x] Round to nearest whole number\n- [x] Write final answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
